--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
Returning a braced-init-list from a function whose return type has a
viable initializer-list constructor must list-initialize the returned
object with the whole list as a single std::initializer_list argument.
Regression: a single-element return was unwrapped and the element was
converted directly to the class type, rejecting valid code and crashing.
